This repository makes ReSkate, by Dingo Shenanigans and its contributors,
run on ARM64 Linux handhelds through Proton and FEX.
ReSkate: https://github.com/Dingo-Shenanigans/ReSkate
Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
The patches in patches/ change ReSkate; the workflows download ReSkate from
its own repository at build time and build the launcher from that source
with the patches applied.

